# Main UI Viewport - White text on Black (iClassic approach)
# The UI list draws on the left; when HOLD is on we shrink it so the list can't
# draw over the lockscreen wallpaper (adwaitapod approach).
%Vi(UiMenu,0,24,160,216,3)%Vf(F7F4FA)%Vb(0F0E14)
%?if(%cs, =, 21)<%VI(USB)|%?mh<|%VI(UiMenu)>>
